    "title": "Beauty Sweet Plus - Camera",
    "description": "<b>Create beautiful and natural looking photos and video selfies every time with Beauty Sweet, the popular selfie cam and beauty editor.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u2665 Beauty Sweet for Sweet Selfies:</b>\r\n* Get perfect photos in a snap with auto- beautifying tools or manually edit the way you want. You can also manually edit your portraits by erasing dark circles and under-eye bags, brightening eyes to make them sparkle, brightening your smile in seconds with our teeth whitening tool, plumping your lips with our nudge tools and more.\r\n* Getting flawless skin is also easy. Swipe to get perfect skin with our smoothing tool, or tap to remove blemishes and erase pimples.\r\n* Don't forget our AR filters. Try on cute cat ears, pretty flower crowns, or hilarious poop-emoji hats with AR Filters. More filters are always being added!\r\n\r\n<b>\u2665 Beauty Sweet for Perfect Shape:</b>\r\n* Body reshaping tools allow you to get the results you want easily. \r\n* Super intuitive and easy to use the body editor. You can adjust any part of your body into perfect shape by using the slim tool, such as waist, arm, face, legs, and more. \r\n* You can also go from 5'4\u201d to 5' MORE with our height adjusting tool.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2665Beauty Sweet - Various Filters for Different Styles:</b>\r\nAesthetic sparkle filter, film filter, food filter...There are over 1000 filters to help you find the style that matches your feelings in the app. Add filters to your photos and get different styles.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2665 Beauty Sweet - Editing Tools:</b>\r\n* Photo Repair: Fast & automatic! Time to fix your old blurry photos and increase image resolution using our AI technology!\r\n* Blur: Create depth effects with our Blur tool. You can blur the image background, or blur the face, or blur the whole image easily.\r\n* Crop: Easily crop photos with custom or pre-set sizes in the photo editor.\r\n* Adjust: Over a dozen tools to control color and light, including contrast, saturation, color temp, shadow, fade, and more.\r\n\r\nLet's download Beauty Sweet -Selfie Editor to take selfies and edit photos with beautifying features, filters, AR stickers and makeup!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Sweet Selfie Plus: Beauty Sweet with Powerful Photo Editor, Photo Collage & Stickers cool face stickers and sweet stickers for you\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Beauty Sweet - Sweet Selfie: Beauty Selfie and Photo Editor is a free Beauty Selfie Cam helping you remove blemish and slim face.\r\nDownload Beauty Plus - Sweet Selfie Now! The Best Photo Edit App Only for You.\r\nEdit, Share, and Enjoy Your Life!",
